<title>MALAYSIA: Seal says eyes development project.</title>
<headline>Seal says eyes development project.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian timber products firm Seal Inc Bhd said on Friday that it was eyeing a proposed acquisition and development project.</p>
<p>&quot;The company is currently finalising the details of a proposed acquisition and development project,&quot; Seal said in a statement to explain why it was asking for an extension to the suspension of its stock.</p>
<p>The shares were last traded on June 12 at 4.88 ringgit.</p>
